{"step_index":199,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-08T09:24:32Z","content":"You can run both the backend and frontend servers directly in your terminal windows using the steps below:\n\n### 1. Start the Backend API (FastAPI)\nOpen a terminal in the project directory and run:\n```powershell\ncd backend\npython main.py\n```\n* **API Documentation (Swagger UI)**: [http://127.0.0.1:8001/docs](http://127.0.0.1:8001/docs)\n\n---\n\n### 2. Start the Frontend Web UI (React + Vite)\nOpen a second terminal window and run:\n```powershell\ncd frontend\nnpm run dev\n```\n* **Web Dashboard**: [http://localhost:5173](http://localhost:5173)\n\n---\n\n### 3. Alternative: Run via Docker Compose\nIf you prefer running everything via Docker:\n```powershell\ndocker-compose up --build\n```"}
